17
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:44,958
Mom, do you remember what I told
you about the Hollywood Executive?

18
00:01:46,291 --> 00:01:49,291
The project I was supposed to do here?

19
00:01:51,583 --> 00:01:53,250
